The above reference contract is hereby modified in the manner set forth inthe following and such
amendments and modifications are agreed tobythe undersigned, being parties to this contract and
agreement. All other aspects of the agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.
I. Description of Changes:
Original Contract Amount:
$ 706,166.03
Modification #1:
$ 107,505.38
Modification Total
$ 107,505.38
New Contract Total:
$ 813,671.41
I1. Contract Items:
All items to remain the same as original agreement.
III.Schedule:
The services of this Agreement shall commence on the date stipulated in the"Notice to Proceed"
that will be issued by the City. The work shall be completed within sixty (60) calendar days. If the
work has not been completed within the time stipulated above, including any extensions of time
issued by the Cityfor excusable delays, the Contractor and his sureties shall pay the City fixed,
agreed liquidated damages, as stipulated in the Supplemental Conditions, foreach calendar day of
delay until the work is completed.
IV.Summary:
Unforeseen expenses due to soil conditions and weather.
